<title>USA: Campbell consolidating Ramen Noodle opns.</title>
<headline>Campbell consolidating Ramen Noodle opns.</headline>
<dateline>CAMDEN, N.J. 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Campbell Soup Co said on Thursday it would consolidate production at its Ramen Noodle facility in Atlanta into its main City of Industry, Calif., plant.</p>
<p>It cited excess capacity in its manufacturing system.</p>
<p>Company spokesmen were not available to say whether Campbell would take a charge related to the consolidation.</p>
</text>
